{% comment %}
  compare-page — 对比页主体（SDD §6.2）。挂在 `templates/page.compare.json` 上。

  ## 为什么是一个 section 而不是三个
  SDD/pages-ui 原设想拆 compare-intro / compare-data / compare-table。实现时合并，
  原因是三者必须共享**同一份商品列表**：
  · 拆开 → 每个 section 各查一次集合，数据库开销翻倍；
  · 合并 → 一次查询同时产出默认表与数据岛，且两者天然同源，不可能不一致。
  数据岛仍然放在 DOM 末尾、只序列化当前分组的白名单字段、列式编码，位置闸与
  字段闸不变；唯一变化是数据岛与表头缩略图共享同一次查询（原纪律「数据岛模板
  只碰 metafield」是为分离模板服务的，合并后不再适用）。

  ## 分组从哪来
  `page.handle` 必须以 `-compare` 结尾，去掉后缀即分组键（§6.2.1）。
  例：标题「Chainsaw Compare」→ handle `chainsaw-compare` → 分组 `chainsaw`。

  ## 商品从哪来
  Liquid **无法按 metafield 查询商品**，只能走集合。所以每个分组需要一个集合：
  商家在主题设置 `compare_collections` 里选，集合用 metafield `custom.compare_group`
  声明归属（未声明则退回「集合 handle 等于分组键」）。
  集合缺失 → 显示配置提示，不渲染空表骨架（§6.2.2 空状态）。

  ## 编排
  ① 界内：标题 + 选型文案 + 服务端默认表（可索引、无 JS 可读）
  ② 界外末尾：`<script type="application/json" id="cmp-data">` 数据岛
  JS 有有效选择时用同一标记结构重建表格并替换（§6.2.4）。

{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign compare_group = ''
  assign compare_handle = page.handle | default: ''

  assign tail = compare_handle | slice: -8, 8
  if tail == '-compare'
    assign compare_group = compare_handle | remove: '-compare'
  endif

  assign row_keys = ''
  case compare_group
    when 'walk-behind-mower', 'riding-mower'
      assign row_keys = 'power_source,operation_type,drive_type,area_coverage,duty_level,cutting_width_mm,power,weight_kg,noise_db,warranty_months' | split: ','
    when 'chainsaw'
      assign row_keys = 'power_source,operation_type,area_coverage,duty_level,bar_length_mm,power,weight_kg,noise_db,warranty_months' | split: ','
    when 'string-trimmer'
      assign row_keys = 'power_source,operation_type,area_coverage,duty_level,cutting_width_mm,power,weight_kg,noise_db,warranty_months' | split: ','
    else
      assign row_keys = 'power_source,operation_type,area_coverage,duty_level,power,weight_kg,noise_db,warranty_months' | split: ','
  endcase

  assign compare_collection = blank
  for candidate in settings.compare_collections
    assign declared = candidate.metafields.custom.compare_group.value
    if declared == blank
      assign declared = candidate.handle
    endif
    if declared == compare_group
      assign compare_collection = candidate
      break
    endif
  endfor

  assign compare_products = compare_collection.products
  assign compare_total = 0
  if compare_collection != blank
    assign compare_total = compare_products.size
  endif

  assign default_columns = settings.compare_default_columns | default: 3
  assign over_limit = false
  if compare_total > 50
    assign over_limit = true
  endif

  assign datasheet_limit = 50

  assign compare_heading = section.settings.heading
  if compare_heading == blank
    assign compare_heading = page.title
  endif
  if compare_heading == blank
    assign compare_heading = 'compare.page.default_title' | t
  endif
-%}

{%- if compare_group == blank -%}

  <div class="compare-page__notice">
    <p>{{ 'compare.page.group_missing' | t }}</p>
  </div>

{%- elsif compare_collection == blank -%}

  <div class="compare-page__notice">
    <p>{{ 'compare.page.collection_missing' | t }}</p>
    <a class="compare-page__back" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
      {{- 'compare.page.back' | t -}}
    </a>
  </div>

{%- elsif compare_total < 2 -%}

  <div class="compare-page__notice">
    <p>{{ 'compare.page.empty_group' | t }}</p>
    <a class="compare-page__back" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
      {{- 'compare.page.back' | t -}}
    </a>
  </div>

{%- else -%}

  <section class="compare-page" data-compare-page data-compare-group="{{ compare_group }}">
    <header class="compare-page__header">
      <h1 class="compare-page__title">
        {{ compare_heading }}
      </h1>
      {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
        <div class="compare-page__intro">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </header>

    {%- comment -%}
      服务端默认表：爬虫、无 JS、JS 报错时页面仍有实质内容。
      JS 接管后会用同一标记结构重建（class 名与 compare.js 里的构建函数保持一致）。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="compare-table-wrap" data-compare-table-wrap>
      <table class="compare-table">
        <caption class="visually-hidden">
          {{ 'compare.heading' | t }}
        </caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="compare-table__corner">
              <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'compare.rows.power_source' | t }}</span>
            </th>
            {%- for product in compare_products limit: default_columns -%}
              <th scope="col" class="compare-table__col">
                <a class="compare-table__product" href="{{ product.url }}">
                  {%- if product.featured_image -%}
                    {{
                      product.featured_image
                      | image_url: width: 200
                      | image_tag:
                        widths: '100, 200',
                        sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 180px, 45vw',
                        width: product.featured_image.width,
                        height: product.featured_image.height,
                        loading: 'lazy',
                        alt: product.featured_image.alt
                    }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <span class="compare-table__product-title">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
                </a>
                {%- assign variance_note = product.metafields.spec.spec_variance_note.value -%}
                {%- if variance_note != blank -%}
                  <details class="compare-table__note">
                    <summary aria-label="{{ 'compare.page.variant_note' | t: title: product.title }}">
                      <span aria-hidden="true">i</span>
                    </summary>
                    <p>{{ variance_note }}</p>
                  </details>
                {%- endif -%}
              </th>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {%- for row_key in row_keys -%}
            <tr>
              <th scope="row" class="compare-table__row-label">
                {%- render 'compare-row-label', row_key: row_key -%}
              </th>
              {%- for product in compare_products limit: default_columns -%}
                <td class="compare-table__cell">
                  {%- render 'compare-cell', product: product, row_key: row_key -%}
                </td>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </tr>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    {%- if over_limit -%}
      <p class="compare-page__limit">
        {{ 'compare.page.over_limit' | t: count: compare_total, limit: 50 }}
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </section>

  {%- comment -%}
    数据岛（§6.2.1）：DOM 末尾、列式编码、只装当前分组的白名单字段。
    不含价格 / 图片 / 库存 —— JS 侧缩略图取自 localStorage 里加入时存下的 120px 派生图。
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture compare_rows_json -%}
    {%- for row_key in row_keys -%}
      {%- if forloop.index > 1 -%},{%- endif -%}
      {%- capture row_label -%}{%- render 'compare-row-label', row_key: row_key -%}{%- endcapture -%}{"k":{{ row_key | json }},"l":{{ row_label | strip | json }}}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- capture compare_items_json -%}
    {%- for product in compare_products limit: datasheet_limit -%}
      {%- if forloop.index > 1 -%},{%- endif -%}
      {"h":{{ product.handle | json }},"t":{{ product.title | json }},"u":{{ product.url | json }},"n":{{ product.metafields.spec.spec_variance_note.value | json }},"v":[
      {%- for row_key in row_keys -%}
        {%- if forloop.index > 1 -%},{%- endif -%}
        {%- capture cell_text -%}{%- render 'compare-cell', product: product, row_key: row_key, as_text: true -%}{%- endcapture -%}
        {{ cell_text | strip | json }}
      {%- endfor -%}
      ]}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  <script
    type="application/json"
    id="cmp-data"
    data-default-columns="{{ default_columns }}"
    data-label-not-in-scope="{{ 'compare.page.not_in_scope' | t }}"
    data-label-variant-note="{{ 'compare.page.variant_note' | t }}"
    data-label-diff-only="{{ 'compare.page.diff_only' | t }}"
    data-label-loaded="{{ 'compare.page.loaded' | t: count: '[count]' }}"
  >
    {"group":{{ compare_group | json }},"rows":[{{ compare_rows_json }}],"items":[{{ compare_items_json }}]}
  </script>

{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
/* ===== 对比页（SDD §6.2）=====
   颜色一律由主题令牌派生；表格用 caption + th scope 支撑屏读顺序。
   移动端横滚 + 首列与表头 sticky（§6.2.4）。 */

.compare-page-section {
  --compare-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 14%, transparent);
  --compare-muted: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 60%, transparent);
}

.compare-page {
  max-inline-size: 1400px;
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
}

.compare-page__header {
  margin-block-end: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
}

.compare-page__title {
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
  line-height: 1.15;
}

.compare-page__intro {
  max-inline-size: 62ch;
  color: var(--color-foreground);
}

.compare-page__notice {
  max-inline-size: 62ch;
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
  text-align: center;
}

.compare-page__back {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  min-block-size: 44px;
  margin-block-start: 1rem;
  padding-inline: 1.25rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
  border-radius: 4px;
  color: var(--color-foreground);
  text-decoration: none;
}

.compare-page__limit {
  margin-block-start: 1rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--compare-muted);
}

.compare-table-wrap {
  overflow-x: auto;
}

.compare-table {
  inline-size: 100%;
  min-inline-size: 640px;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.compare-table th,
.compare-table td {
  padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
  border-block-end: 1px solid var(--compare-border);
  text-align: start;
  vertical-align: top;
}

.compare-table thead th {
  border-block-end-width: 2px;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.compare-table__corner {
  inline-size: 10rem;
}

.compare-table__col {
  min-inline-size: 11rem;
}

.compare-table__product {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.compare-table__product img {
  inline-size: 100%;
  block-size: auto;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  object-fit: contain;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 4%, var(--color-background));
}

.compare-table__product-title {
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.compare-table__row-label {
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--compare-muted);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.compare-table__value--missing {
  color: var(--compare-muted);
}

/* 变体差异提示：原生 details，自带展开状态与键盘支持（§6.2.4） */
.compare-table__note {
  margin-block-start: 0.35rem;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
}

.compare-table__note summary {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  inline-size: 20px;
  block-size: 20px;
  border: 1px solid var(--compare-border);
  border-radius: 50%;
  cursor: pointer;
  list-style: none;
}

.compare-table__note summary::-webkit-details-marker {
  display: none;
}

.compare-table__note p {
  margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
  color: var(--compare-muted);
}

@media (max-width: 767px) {
  .compare-table thead th {
    position: sticky;
    inset-block-start: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }

  .compare-table__row-label {
    position: sticky;
    inset-inline-start: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.compare_page.name",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "compare-page-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:sections.compare_page.settings.heading.label",
      "info": "t:sections.compare_page.settings.heading.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "t:sections.compare_page.settings.intro.label",
      "info": "t:sections.compare_page.settings.intro.info"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.compare_page.presets.name"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
